<h3><u>Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Tanha Humein Dasht Mein Kaisay Bhala Chorh Gaey, Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey, Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey</p>
<ol><li>Aray, Degaey Ho Itnay Ghum Jee Sakeingay Kaisay Hum(a.s.)</li><p>Aray, Hogaya Kaisa Sitam Ghum Say Kamar Hai Yeh Khum</p><p>Guzri Meray Dil Peh Kia Kaisay Bataaon Tujhay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Dekh Meri Bebasi Karbobala Kay Ali(a.s.)</li><p>Aray, Had Say Barhhi Tashnagi Ghairay Hain Mujh(a.s.) Ko Shaqi</p><p>Halq Peh Kia Janiey Kab Meray Khanjar Chalay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Tum(a.s.) To Alamdar Thay Bhayi Kay Gumkhuar Thay</li><p>Aray, Kitanay Wafadar Thay Fauj Kay Saalaar Thay</p><p>Ab Yeh Alam Fauj Ka Hum(a.s.) Bhala Daingay Kisay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Doon Main(a.s.) Kisay Ab Sada Ran Mein Hon Tanha Kharha</li><p>Aray, Waqt-e-Ajal Aagaya Khushk Hai Mera Gala</p><p>Chalnay Ko Talwaar Hai Khushk Galay Par Meray </p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Baad Meray Hoga Kia Yeh Nahi Tujh(a.s.) Ko Pata</li><p>Aray, Sab Saron Say Rida Looteingay Yeh Ashkia</p><p>Fauj-e-Sitam Bandhay Gi Aihl-e-Haram(a.s.) Kay Galay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Aankh Main Khoon Hai Bhara Teer Hai Aisa Laga</li><p>Aray, Hogaey Baazoo Juda Sar Bhi Dopara Hua</p><p>Bhai Yeh Halat Teri Jeenay Na Degi Mujhay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Taigh Talay Shah(a.s.) Deen Sajday Main Rakhkar Jabeen</li><p>Aray, Kehtay Thay Sun Aey Zamin Ab Mera Koi Nahin</p><p>Woh Jo Thay Baazoo Meray Neht Peh Kaatay Gaey</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Teray Saharay Bahan(s.a.) Chorh Kay Aai Watan</li><p>Aray, Bhar Gaya Laashon Say Ban Lashein Hai Sab Bekafan</p><p>Kis Ko Pukaray Bahan(s.a.) Sar Say Jo Chadar Chinay</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Bali Sakina(s.a.) Teri Jo Hai Teri Ladli</li><p>Aray, Mashk Tujhay Dechuki Dar Peh Hai Ab Bhi Kharhi</p><p>Nehr Ko Takti Hai Woh Hathon Mein Kooza Liey</p><p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p><li>Aray, Jee Kay Karon Kia Main Ab Hogaya Aisa Ghazab</li></ol>

<p>Aray, Jeetay Thay Jis Kay Sabab Janay Mileingay Woh(a.s.) Kab</p>
<p>Qatl Kareingay Udo Tanha Humein Dekh Kay</p>
<p>(Haaey Kamar Torh Gaey Bhayi Kamar Torh Gaey) x2</p></font></p>
